title: "ShockBridge Pulse: When Signals Stop Working - Predictive Alpha via Empirical Microstructure"
version: 4.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-12
url: "https://github.com/rolffcoelho-bravo/when-signals-stop-working"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rolffcoelho-bravo/when-signals-stop-working"
abstract: >-
  A quantitative research framework demonstrating that lagging retail indicators (RSI, Bollinger Bands, Moving Medians, Fibonacci) fail catastrophically during market panic regimes. It introduces a V4 Empirical Microstructure engine utilizing real Binance Funding Rate Z-Scores and Quote Asset Volume Velocity to generate pure predictive Alpha prior to liquidation cascades, mathematically proven via strict out-of-sample TimeSeries splits.
